`W(g^u) · W = −J P_{u⁻¹}` by the geometric sum, so the two do not commute when `u² ≢ 1 (mod 4κ)` (6:C11); the chart
`g^{u²}` of an odd `u` is the coordinate relabelling `m ↦ um` of `F` (6:C6), and the frames `g = 2, 6` of `p = 13`
